READING={"title":"The talent day","passage":"Our class has a talent day. Amal can sing and play the piano. Zaid can draw funny pictures, but he can’t sing. Rami and Sami can play football very well. I can use a computer, so I can help the teacher make a poster. We all have different talents.","arabic_support":"مساعدة: talent تعني موهبة، وdifferent تعني مختلفة.","questions":(aq("What can Amal do?",("sing and play piano","draw","football"),"sing and play piano"),aq("Who can draw?",("Amal","Zaid","teacher"),"Zaid"),aq("Why can the writer help?",("can use computer","can sing","can cook"),"can use computer"))}
